Package: networkPlot
Title: Pathway Enrichment and Visualisation of Kinase Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dora", "Schuller", email = "dschuller@pamgene.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pathway enrichment (one-sided Fisher with Benjamini-Hochberg
    correction on Reactome v2, against the kinases UKA can predict) of the
    input kinases of a kinase network built by networkGen (or of UKA data
    directly), the interactive visNetwork HTML rendering of the network, and
    kinase-by-pathway heatmaps. Every styling choice for the HTML lives in a
    single theme object.
